description	"Serra Keto

^9Weapons:
- Dynamic Melee
^2-- Damage: 1.5x
^2-- RoF: 1.17x
- Lightsabers ^9(Dual)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Saber Mastery (1)
^2-- Spec Damage: 1.45x

^3Abilities:
- Saber Throw (1) ^3[Saber CS1]
^2-- Damage: 60
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Butterfly Kick ^9(Barge 1) ^3[Melee CS4]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (1)
- Sense (1)
- Protect (2)
- Speed (3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (1)
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Healing (1)
- BP-Free Jumps
^1- Skill Recharge: .8x

Cin Drallig's finest pupil and a dynamic Jar'Kai specialist. She is a practitioner of unorthodox Melee skills that can be chained in disorienting ways."